rene: Quick notice  planning a small cleanup for the hello-lite quickstart. Goals: switch auth snippets to SDK v8 ephemeral keys, simplify the single-file copy/paste example, and replace docker env_file usage. Will touch docs/quickstart/hello-lite.md, samples/hello-lite, and snippets/auth.md. Any blockers?

